<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 14:02:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>自制遥控四驱割草机</title><link>https://some.pics/6a6caad16848b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这是我们不断壮大的DIY大家庭的最新成员。基本上，它是一台安装在焊接车架上的割草机，配备四轮驱动，后部装有可充电电池。前半部分由半条轮胎保护。当然，它支持遥控操作，还装了一对斗鸡眼。我们还没给它想好合适的名字。有什么建议吗？&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="The described remote control lawnmower in-between shrubbs " height="3008" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a6caad16848b.jpg" width="3008"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 14:02:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a6c8888383a7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我新培养的爱好（也是最接近我心头好的一项）是戳戳绣，而这一个更是其中的佼佼者。接下来我打算用剩下的毛线创作点抽象作品 🙂&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="My new (and close to favourite) hobby is punch needling, and this one is the best of the bunch. Now going to make something abstract with the remaining yarn 🙂" height="3791" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sylvia/6a6c8888383a7.jpg" width="5055"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sylvia.some.pics"&gt;@sylvia&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 11:35:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a6c61e6b1f66</link><description>&lt;p&gt;随手用交叉排线的方式，给Mastodon的Logo做了一版风格化的演绎。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A stylized sketch of the Mastodon logo featuring a large purple lowercase “m” with a black shadow effect. The logo is surrounded by layers of loose white and gray crosshatching, with additional dark crosshatching inside the purple and black areas. The artist’s signature, “Darren Hester,” appears near the lower right of the logo." height="1630" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6a6c61e6b1f66.jpg" width="1630"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 08:50:49 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>晨跑早安</title><link>https://some.pics/6a6c3e03c354e</link><description>&lt;p&gt;早上好！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="🏃🏻 Goeiemorgen deze morgen!" height="1486" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a6c3e03c354e.jpg" width="1179"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 06:17:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a6bb64715f53</link><description>&lt;p&gt;带有黄色字母“Friedenau”的绿色路牌，上方有一个指示停车区域结束的标志。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='Green road sign with "Friedenau" in yellow lettering, above a sign indicating the end of a parking zone.

Grünes Ortsschild mit gelber Aufschrift "Friedenau", darüber ein Schild, das das Ende einer Parkraumbewirtschaftungszone anzeigt.' height="2410" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6a6bb64715f53.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 20:38:34 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>